OL,3,GNEWSAStretch of London's famous Oxford
OL,4,AStreet becomes pedestrian only
OL,5,
OL,6,FCars, buses, taxis and bicycles can no
OL,7,Flonger travel along much of Oxford
OL,8,FStreet with almost a kilometre of the
OL,9,Froad now pedestrianised
OL,11,FThe famous London shopping street has
OL,12,Fbeen made traffic free between Orchard
OL,13,FStreet and Great Portland Street
OL,15,FVehicles will still be able to flow
OL,16,Fnorth and south across the street at
OL,17,Fcertain points, while buses are being
OL,18,Fdiverted on to other roads
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
