OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAStretch of London's famous Oxford
OL,4,AStreet becomes pedestrian only
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pedestrianisation of Oxford Street
OL,7,Fhas been tried for years but is
OL,8,Fcontroversial, with local residents
OL,9,Famong those worried about the change
OL,11,FThe traffic may have been stopped but
OL,12,Fthe initial works scheme is not
OL,13,Fexpected to be completed until spring
OL,14,Fnext year. Find out more about the
OL,15,Fchanges here
